WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 adc178ab672a3a173f5c05143ef72609

00:00:00.418 --> 00:00:03.938
Nimekuwa nikifanya kazi katika elimu
kwa zaidi ya miaka 15 sasa.

00:00:04.578 --> 00:00:09.137
Na jambo moja nililojifunza
ni kwamba watu wanapokwama,

00:00:10.178 --> 00:00:13.298
wanaposhindwa kuelewa jambo fulani
au wanapoona jambo ni gumu mno,

00:00:13.778 --> 00:00:16.617
wanaweza kukerwa sana, sana.

00:00:16.617 --> 00:00:21.178
Wanaweza kukasirika sana. Kulikuwa na
kipindi kimoja mara baada ya

00:00:21.178 --> 00:00:26.327
vizuizi vya COVID-19, ambapo nilikuwa nikipokea
barua pepe kila wiki, wakati mwingine kila siku,

00:00:26.728 --> 00:00:30.568
ambazo kimsingi zilisema tu,
kufa. Zilikuwa kama, nenda ukafe.

00:00:30.888 --> 00:00:33.847
Kwa kawaida kulikuwa na matusi
mengi zaidi ambayo sitayaweka hapa,

00:00:34.648 --> 00:00:39.847
mara nyingi bila maelezo mengi. Tu,
nakuchukia, nachukia tovuti yako.

00:00:40.408 --> 00:00:42.207
Na hii ilikuwa kwa Exercism, nayo ilikuwa bure.

00:00:42.207 --> 00:00:45.207
Watu walikuwa wakijisajili na kutumia
tovuti hii bure ili kujifunza

00:00:45.607 --> 00:00:47.048
na wakawa na hasira sana.

00:00:48.567 --> 00:00:50.487
Na zoezi hili tunaloliangalia hapa,

00:00:51.008 --> 00:00:53.807
bado sijapata mtu yeyote
aliyekasirika kiasi hicho,

00:00:54.368 --> 00:00:58.287
lakini nimepata watu wachache
ambao wamekerwa sana kwa kweli.

00:00:59.408 --> 00:01:03.648
Na mara nyingi watu wanapokerwa kiasi hicho,
sielewi kabisa ni kwa nini.

00:01:04.447 --> 00:01:06.287
Na zoezi hili ni mfano mzuri.

00:01:06.287 --> 00:01:10.847
Mimi tu, sijui kwa nini watu wanaliona gumu,
lakini wengine kweli wanaliona gumu sana.

00:01:10.927 --> 00:01:12.688
Na mojawapo ya mambo
niliyogundua kuhusu watu hawa

00:01:12.688 --> 00:01:16.397
wanaokasirika sana na kunitumia
barua pepe ni kwamba pia huacha kwa hasira.

00:01:17.028 --> 00:01:18.707
Yaani, mimi huandika barua pepe nzuri ya kujibu.

00:01:18.707 --> 00:01:22.268
Husema, unajua, samahani sana kwa dhati
kwamba ulikerwa sana.

00:01:22.268 --> 00:01:25.987
Sitaki hivyo hata kidogo.
Tafadhali niambie nini kilienda vibaya.

00:01:26.067 --> 00:01:29.427
Tafadhali niambie, unajua, kwa nini ilikera
kiasi hicho, nami nitajaribu kuirekebisha.

00:01:29.828 --> 00:01:34.548
Na, watu karibu hawajibu kamwe. Wakati mwingine
hujibu, na kwa kawaida wao

00:01:34.548 --> 00:01:38.308
hueleza tu jinsi ninavyopaswa kufa
kwa ubunifu zaidi kidogo.

00:01:38.947 --> 00:01:41.108
Lakini kwa kawaida watu hawajibu kabisa.

00:01:41.908 --> 00:01:42.477
Na

00:01:43.498 --> 00:01:44.778
ndiyo, ndivyo ilivyokuwa kwa zoezi hili.

00:01:44.778 --> 00:01:46.457
Watu wachache wamekerwa.

00:01:46.697 --> 00:01:51.537
Sijui hasa ni nini kinacholifanya kuwa
tata na gumu, lakini kwa pamoja,

00:01:51.537 --> 00:01:53.737
hebu tutumie dakika chache
kulipitia hatua kwa hatua, na

00:01:53.737 --> 00:01:58.177
nitachimba kwa kina na kujaribu kuhakikisha
ninagusia kila kitu ninachoweza kufikiria,

00:01:58.177 --> 00:02:01.737
ili kuhakikisha kwamba kama umekwama
na unatazama video hii,

00:02:02.537 --> 00:02:04.218
tafadhali usinitumie barua pepe mbaya.

00:02:04.218 --> 00:02:07.897
Tafadhali usikasirike na kukata tamaa.
Tafadhali nijulishe tatizo ni nini.

00:02:07.897 --> 00:02:10.098
Kwa sababu ukiniambia tatizo ni nini
na ukiniambia umekwama wapi,

00:02:10.098 --> 00:02:13.617
kwa kweli naweza kusaidia. Na kama utawahi
kufika mwisho wa zoezi na

00:02:13.617 --> 00:02:17.957
ukahisi lilikuwa la kukera mno, tafadhali andika tu
kwenye jukwaa useme, hili lilikuwa baya kabisa.

00:02:17.957 --> 00:02:19.798
Kama, na, hii ndiyo sababu lilikuwa baya.

00:02:20.207 --> 00:02:24.318
Nitashukuru sana kwa maoni hayo
na nitaenda kuboresha mazoezi.

00:02:24.318 --> 00:02:27.557
Mimi si mtu atakayejitetea
ukiniambia hivyo.

00:02:28.437 --> 00:02:30.677
Kwa hiyo zoezi hili, na kama, kama kawaida,

00:02:30.677 --> 00:02:34.557
kama umelitatua sasa hivi na lilikuwa sawa
na hukupata tatizo lolote nalo,

00:02:34.557 --> 00:02:37.638
hongera. Kama umekwama,
hakuna aibu yoyote.

00:02:37.638 --> 00:02:39.638
Inaonekana watu wengine wengi
hukwama hapa pia.

00:02:39.638 --> 00:02:41.318
Kwa hiyo hebu tulitatue.

00:02:42.448 --> 00:02:46.367
Katika zoezi hili, una kitendakazi pan.

00:02:47.168 --> 00:02:51.008
Basi kitendakazi pan ni nini? Kuchuja dhahabu
ni kutumbukiza, aina fulani ya,

00:02:51.008 --> 00:02:56.048
bakuli lako mtoni na kulitoa
ukitumaini kuna dhahabu ndani yake.

00:02:56.158 --> 00:02:58.608
Na wakati mwingine, ukiwa na bahati, ipo.

00:02:58.768 --> 00:03:01.487
Mara nyingi haipo. Mara nyingi
zaidi, haipo.

00:03:01.728 --> 00:03:06.048
Lakini wakati mwingine unachuja mtoni
na dhahabu kidogo inatoka.

00:03:07.498 --> 00:03:11.658
Kwa hiyo kitendakazi hiki, pan, kinarejesha
idadi ya vipande vya dhahabu unavyopata.

00:03:12.457 --> 00:03:17.098
Kisha mwishoni una kitendakazi sell
cha kuuza idadi ya vipande hivyo.

00:03:18.538 --> 00:03:21.298
Tunajifunza kwamba una roboti
unayoitengeneza,

00:03:21.298 --> 00:03:25.418
na roboti hiyo ina uwezo wa kutosha
kuchuja mara chache kabla ya kuuza.

00:03:26.298 --> 00:03:28.938
Na unahitaji kuandika msimbo wako
ili iende mtoni.

00:03:29.098 --> 00:03:33.818
Ichuje mara tano,
ikifuatilia kiasi cha dhahabu kilichokusanywa,

00:03:34.168 --> 00:03:37.128
kisha iuze jumla ya vipande vya dhahabu.

00:03:38.248 --> 00:03:39.208
Kwa hiyo mimi,

00:03:41.768 --> 00:03:43.688
ninafikiri nini ninaposoma haya?

00:03:43.848 --> 00:03:47.208
Basi mimi. Kwa sababu daima kuna dalili,
daima kuna kama vidokezo vidogo.

00:03:47.208 --> 00:03:50.608
Si kwamba ninaandika vidokezo,
ila tu unaposoma kitu,

00:03:50.608 --> 00:03:53.288
jaribu kuufanya ubongo wako
uanze kuvitambua vidokezo hivi.

00:03:54.247 --> 00:03:54.648
Kwa hiyo

00:03:55.768 --> 00:03:57.128
ichuje mara tano.

00:03:58.008 --> 00:04:00.128
Hilo linanipigia kelele neno kitanzi.

00:04:00.128 --> 00:04:01.848
Linasema lazima kuwe na kitanzi hapa.

00:04:01.848 --> 00:04:04.158
Ninafanya kitu kilekile
mara nyingi.

00:04:05.198 --> 00:04:06.557
Ikifuatilia.

00:04:07.598 --> 00:04:09.078
Tunafuatiliaje kitu?

00:04:09.078 --> 00:04:12.478
Tunatumia variable. Tuna sanduku
lenye namba fulani au chochote ndani yake.

00:04:12.798 --> 00:04:15.918
Kwa hiyo kufuatilia huku kunaniambia,
tumia variable

00:04:16.478 --> 00:04:18.798
kisha kuuza jumla.

00:04:18.878 --> 00:04:21.358
Kwa hiyo hiki ndicho kitu
tunachokifuatilia.

00:04:22.557 --> 00:04:25.677
Ninaona kwamba pia tunahitaji kufanya hivi
kwa mistari mitano ya msimbo, lakini,

00:04:26.427 --> 00:04:28.638
hebu turudi kwenye hilo mwishoni, labda.

00:04:29.117 --> 00:04:33.557
Basi, basi hebu kwanza tuwe na variable
ya kuanzia, ambayo ni total.

00:04:34.117 --> 00:04:38.758
Tuseme total ni sawa na sifuri. Mwanzoni,
hatuna dhahabu yoyote.

00:04:39.958 --> 00:04:44.518
Kisha tunahitaji kuchuja. Kwa hiyo
tunatumia tu kitendakazi hiki pan.

00:04:44.758 --> 00:04:46.278
Na hiki kitakuwa,

00:04:47.638 --> 00:04:51.557
hebu tuwe na variable mpya hapa
iitwayo amount of gold found

00:04:53.077 --> 00:04:53.718
kutoka pan.

00:04:55.158 --> 00:04:57.077
Kisha tunataka kuiongeza kwenye total yetu.

00:04:57.077 --> 00:05:01.888
Kwa hiyo tunataka kusema total ni sawa na total
jumlisha amount of gold found.

00:05:03.648 --> 00:05:05.487
Kisha tunataka kufanya jambo hili

00:05:06.848 --> 00:05:07.567
mara tano.

00:05:08.687 --> 00:05:10.207
Kisha tunataka

00:05:11.567 --> 00:05:11.968
kuuza

00:05:13.168 --> 00:05:15.327
jumla ya dhahabu tunayopata.

00:05:16.368 --> 00:05:18.368
Kwa hiyo tunaanza na total yetu.

00:05:19.088 --> 00:05:24.368
Mara tano tunachuja, na kila mara
baada ya kuchuja, tutasasisha hii.

00:05:24.687 --> 00:05:28.528
Huo ndio msimbo wetu wa kidhana. Sasa tunaweza
kuona mara moja kwamba tuna

00:05:28.528 --> 00:05:32.628
vitu hivi vitano vinavyofanana.
Kwa hiyo tunaweza kutumia kitanzi cha repeat

00:05:34.307 --> 00:05:35.108
kufanya hivi.

00:05:36.388 --> 00:05:41.108
Kwa hiyo tuna total yetu. Tunachuja
na kupata amount of gold found.

00:05:41.268 --> 00:05:43.987
Tunasasisha total yetu,
kisha tunauza.

00:05:44.388 --> 00:05:46.628
Na tukiendesha msimbo huu, tutaona

00:05:48.228 --> 00:05:50.108
kwamba nimekosea kwa sababu
sikuweka

00:05:50.108 --> 00:05:51.707
idadi ya mara tunazohitaji kurudia.

00:05:51.707 --> 00:05:53.987
Niliandika tu repeat bila kikomo,
na hilo limeharibika.

00:05:53.987 --> 00:05:55.668
Kwa hiyo repeat mara tano.

00:05:56.848 --> 00:05:58.128
Sawa. Na hii inafanya kazi.

00:05:59.088 --> 00:05:59.487
Basi

00:06:00.608 --> 00:06:03.048
natumaini hili halionekani gumu sana.

00:06:03.048 --> 00:06:06.048
Ni mambo tuliyoyafanya awali. pan
kinarejesha kitu.

00:06:06.048 --> 00:06:08.567
Sasa kinarejesha kiasi cha dhahabu kilichopatikana.

00:06:08.567 --> 00:06:12.367
Unaweza kuwasha kile kitufe ili kuona hilo,

00:06:14.848 --> 00:06:19.168
hapa. Kwa hiyo tunatumia kitendakazi pan,
ambacho kilirejesha tatu.

00:06:20.687 --> 00:06:24.207
Tuliunda sanduku hili jipya, tukaweka tatu ndani yake,
kisha kwenye mstari unaofuata,

00:06:24.207 --> 00:06:26.528
tulichukua total na kuisasisha.
Umefanya hivi mara nyingi.

00:06:26.528 --> 00:06:28.098
Sasa, natumaini hili linajulikana kwako.

00:06:31.218 --> 00:06:34.737
Na kwa kweli nataka kuweka hili
kwenye mistari hii mitano ya msimbo.

00:06:35.457 --> 00:06:35.858
Na

00:06:36.658 --> 00:06:40.817
kwa hiyo nilikuambia katika video iliyopita ya uchambuzi
wa kina kuhusu dhana hii ya usemi.

00:06:41.618 --> 00:06:44.418
Kitu kilicho baada ya alama
ya sawa ni usemi.

00:06:44.418 --> 00:06:47.618
Hii 0 ni usemi.
Hii pan ni usemi.

00:06:47.858 --> 00:06:51.858
Hii total jumlisha amount of
gold ni usemi.

00:06:51.937 --> 00:06:54.098
Hizi zote mbili pia ni aina ya usemi.

00:06:54.937 --> 00:06:58.298
Na mojawapo ya sheria tulizonazo ni kwamba
wakati wowote una usemi mmoja,

00:06:58.298 --> 00:07:00.617
unaweza kuubadilisha na usemi mwingine.

00:07:01.018 --> 00:07:05.057
Kwa hiyo hapa,
tunaunda sanduku kwa kutumia kitendakazi na

00:07:05.057 --> 00:07:07.018
kuweka matokeo ya kitendakazi
ndani ya sanduku.

00:07:07.737 --> 00:07:12.617
Badala yake tunaweza kufanya hivi moja kwa moja
bila sanduku hili la katikati.

00:07:14.057 --> 00:07:17.658
Kwa hiyo tunaweza kutumia kitendakazi
na kupata ile tano

00:07:18.057 --> 00:07:20.778
kisha kuiongeza mara moja
kwenye chochote kilicho katika total yetu

00:07:21.218 --> 00:07:22.658
kisha kuirudisha ndani ya sanduku.

00:07:22.737 --> 00:07:24.497
Tukiendesha msimbo huu, bado unafanya kazi.

00:07:24.898 --> 00:07:28.018
Na tukiangalia mstari huu na
kufikiria tena kinachotokea.

00:07:28.177 --> 00:07:32.698
Tunatumia kitendakazi pan. Kwa kweli, kwanza
kabisa, tunachukua sanduku, total ya sasa,

00:07:32.698 --> 00:07:33.937
ambayo kwa wakati huu ni 18,

00:07:34.737 --> 00:07:36.497
kisha tunatumia kitendakazi pan.

00:07:36.497 --> 00:07:40.018
Katika hali hii, kilirejesha moja,
tunazijumlisha pamoja kupata 19.

00:07:40.177 --> 00:07:42.578
Tunachukua sanduku,
kisha tunaiweka ndani ya sanduku.

00:07:43.458 --> 00:07:43.858
Kwa hiyo

00:07:44.978 --> 00:07:47.937
wazo hili kwamba unaweza
kubadilisha usemi mmoja na

00:07:47.937 --> 00:07:50.817
usemi mwingine ni jambo
zuri sana kulielewa kwa kina.

00:07:50.898 --> 00:07:53.747
Ungeweza kufanya hivyohivyo kwa urefu zaidi.

00:07:53.747 --> 00:07:58.187
Ungeweza kusema new total ni sawa na
total jumlisha amount of gold found.

00:07:58.588 --> 00:08:00.987
Kisha ufanye kitu kama hiki.

00:08:02.507 --> 00:08:04.187
Hapa tunaigawanya katika hatua ndogo zaidi.

00:08:04.348 --> 00:08:09.507
Na kwa hiyo sasa tunaona, tunaweza kuchukua
usemi huu na kuuweka hapa, na tunaweza

00:08:09.507 --> 00:08:14.268
kuchukua usemi huu na kuuweka hapa
na kupunguza msimbo wetu uwe nadhifu zaidi.

00:08:15.867 --> 00:08:20.268
Kwa hiyo hii ndiyo njia ya msingi kabisa, ya nguvu
tupu, ya kutatua zoezi hili.

00:08:20.668 --> 00:08:26.108
Unapoendelea kama msanidi programu,
utajua jinsi ya kufanya hivi kwa, tuseme,

00:08:26.108 --> 00:08:31.708
mstari mmoja tu wa msimbo, huenda kwa JavaScript,
kwa njia nadhifu na nzuri zaidi.

00:08:32.028 --> 00:08:34.827
Lakini tutashughulikia yote hayo
baadaye sana.

00:08:34.827 --> 00:08:38.827
Kwa sasa, nataka tu kuunganisha vipande hivi
ili uweze kufikiri: unda sanduku,

00:08:39.228 --> 00:08:42.587
endelea kusasisha sanduku kwa kutumia
kitendakazi kinachorejesha kitu,

00:08:42.908 --> 00:08:45.867
kisha tumia kitendakazi kingine
mwishoni ukiwa na jumla hiyo ndani yake.

00:08:46.758 --> 00:08:49.677
Natumaini hili limeeleweka. Kama halijaeleweka,
tafadhali niambie.

00:08:49.677 --> 00:08:53.077
Tafadhali andika kwenye jukwaa. Au unaweza
pia kuandika maoni kwenye YouTube.

00:08:53.508 --> 00:08:57.117
Natumaini unafurahia
mazoezi, na kama kuna

00:08:57.117 --> 00:09:00.238
lolote utakalokwama nalo,
nataka tu kukuhimiza uwasiliane nasi.

00:09:00.238 --> 00:09:03.158
Kuna watu wengi wakarimu sana kwenye
jukwaa, nami nipo pia.

00:09:03.158 --> 00:09:05.958
Na usisahau, unaweza kumuuliza Jiki
pia wakati wowote ukihisi umekwama.

00:09:06.228 --> 00:09:09.648
Jiki anaweza kukusaidia, na
unaweza kupata vidokezo na

00:09:09.648 --> 00:09:12.677
pia video, nikishazichapisha,
hapa chini pia.

00:09:13.398 --> 00:09:16.758
Basi ndiyo, asante kwa kutazama. Kwaheri
kwa sasa, na natarajia kukuona

00:09:16.758 --> 00:09:18.357
katika video nyingine ya uchambuzi wa kina hivi karibuni.

00:09:18.357 --> 00:09:18.837
Kwaheri.
